    <briefdescription>
<para>Handles touch gestures (drag-to-rotate, pinch-to-scale) and mouse fallback to transform the active patent model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Smoothly interpolates towards <computeroutput>targetRotation</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>targetScale</computeroutput> each frame. Reacts to ScalingModeController.modeChanged, ModelTransformManager.OnLockModel, and ObjectSpawnerAR.objectSpawnedEvent. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
